# Current Features

No product feature was inferred or claimed by workflow installation. Preserve and link existing feature evidence here, or add a feature only after its durable implementation and proof are confirmed.

This file inventories concrete implemented mechanisms such as commands, controls, adapters, formats, jobs, APIs, or target operations. For each feature, record behavior, source refs, verification refs, limitations, and supported environments. The complete outcomes those mechanisms enable belong in `{{OWNER_currentCapabilities}}`; planned mechanisms belong in `{{OWNER_futureFeatures}}`.
